{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wand_master_mage","model_identifier":"wand_master_mage","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## wand_master_mage\n\nMage wand, Master Mage.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..0.9, y -0.9..0.9, z -10.2..3.0 (size 1.9 x 1.9 x 13.2 u = 5 x 5 x 37 cm).\nRank 5 of 6 (Master Mage). Master Mage wand: blackened wood, gold cap, collar and pommel, gold claws holding a bigger gem. About 37 cm. Held in slot_hand_r: grip at the origin, tip forward (-Z). The gem cube is named `glow_*` so the game can light it (violet).\n"},"description":"## wand_master_mage\n\nMage wand, Master Mage.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..0.9, y -0.9..0.9, z -10.2..3.0 (size 1.9 x 1.9 x 13.2 u = 5 x 5 x 37 cm).\nRank 5 of 6 (Master Mage). Master Mage wand: blackened wood, gold cap, collar and pommel, gold claws holding a bigger gem. About 37 cm. Held in slot_hand_r: grip at the origin, tip forward (-Z). The gem cube is named `glow_*` so the game can light it (violet).\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"pommel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.7,-0.7,2.0],"to":[0.7,0.7,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[4,0,5.4,1.4],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,6,1.0,7.4],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[6,0,7.4,1.4],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[1,6,2.0,7.4],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[28,6,29.4,7.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[30,6,31.4,7.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"241f70ec-d4b8-558d-86cb-a68a76082533"},{"name":"grip","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","all